# Unity 的 YAML / C# / JSON 等文本文件统一使用 LF，避免 CRLF 造成整文件 diff
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制资源不要做任何换行转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.psd binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary
*.dll binary
*.so binary
*.a binary
*.bytes binary
*.zip binary
*.unitypackage binary
